     "reason": "At least one required setting differs, but the model remains recognizably the required HIP-NN setup.",
     "judge_reason": "The primary models retain the required HIP-NN architecture, energy-only objective, optimizer, and schedule. Their initialization uses hippynn's Xavier-normal/default-bias behavior rather than the paper's Glorot-uniform weights and zero biases, a disclosed training-protocol deviation. Separate paper-initialization diagnostics do not change the configuration underlying the primary eight-seed results.",
